{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"}],"title":"How to Add a Permanent License"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToAddAPermanentLicense"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtoaddapermanentlicense"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sell a lifetime entitlement alongside a subscription and surface both flags through the paywall plugin."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Many apps offer two ways to buy: a recurring pro subscription and a one-time lifetime purchase. RevenueCat models both as entitlements; ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatPaywallService"},{"text":" checks each independently and surfaces them as the two flags on ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntitlementSnapshot"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"isPro","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — active subscription.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"hasPermanentLicense","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — active lifetime entitlement.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The paywall plugin’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isGateSatisfied"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro || hasPermanentLicense"},{"text":", so feature code keeps a single check while UI can branch on the underlying flags when it needs to.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For the entitlement-mapping rules and edge cases, see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Before you start","level":2,"anchor":"Before-you-start"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This guide assumes:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You have completed ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You have configured ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"two","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" entitlements in the RevenueCat dashboard — typically ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pro"},{"text":" for the subscription and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lifetime"},{"text":" for the one-time purchase. The identifiers are arbitrary; only the strings need to match what you pass into the service.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","text":"Step 1: Pass the second identifier","level":2,"anchor":"Step-1-Pass-the-second-identifier"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Replace the single-entitlement init with the two-arg form:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","","let service = RevenueCatPaywallService(","    entitlementID: \"pro\",","    permanentLicenseEntitlementID: \"lifetime\"",")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Both entitlements are now checked on every ","type":"text"},{"code":"customerInfo()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"customerInfoStream()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" yield, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"restorePurchases()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" call. The active state of ","type":"text"},{"code":"pro","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" flows into ","type":"text"},{"code":"EntitlementSnapshot.isPro","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; the active state of ","type":"text"},{"code":"lifetime","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" flows into ","type":"text"},{"code":"hasPermanentLicense","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The two flags are independent. A user with both active gets both flags set; a user with only one active gets only that flag set."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Step 2: Wire the service into the plugin","anchor":"Step-2-Wire-the-service-into-the-plugin","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Same as the single-entitlement case — the plugin doesn’t need to know about the second identifier:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["plugins.register(","    PaywallPlugin<AppState, AppAction>(","        state: \\.paywall,","        action: AppAction.paywall,","        extractAction: { if case .paywall(let a) = $0 { return a }; return nil },","        service: RevenueCatPaywallService(","            entitlementID: \"pro\",","            permanentLicenseEntitlementID: \"lifetime\"","        )","    )",")"]},{"text":"Step 3: Decide whether feature code needs to branch","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Step-3-Decide-whether-feature-code-needs-to-branch"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For most gated features, keep using "},{"code":"store.paywall.isGateSatisfied","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["if store.paywall.isGateSatisfied { … }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This stays correct whether the user has a subscription or a lifetime license, and works identically in apps that don’t sell a lifetime SKU.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"text":"Step 4: Branch in UI when copy must differ","type":"heading","anchor":"Step-4-Branch-in-UI-when-copy-must-differ"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the paywall sheet should be hidden for lifetime customers (so they’re not pestered to subscribe), or if the customer-center entry should be relabeled, branch on the underlying flag:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["if store.paywall.hasPermanentLicense {","    Text(\"Lifetime member — thank you!\")","} else if store.paywall.isPro {","    Button(\"Manage Subscription\") {","        store.send(.paywall(.presentCustomerCenter))","    }","} else {","    Button(\"Upgrade\") {","        store.send(.paywall(.request(reason: \"upgrade-prompt\")))","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Lifetime users typically have nothing to manage in App Store \/ Settings. Hiding the customer-center button for them avoids dead-end taps.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"When to skip the second identifier","type":"heading","anchor":"When-to-skip-the-second-identifier"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (or omit the parameter) if your app has no lifetime SKU:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["RevenueCatPaywallService(entitlementID: \"pro\")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"type":"text","text":" then stays "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" regardless of any entitlements RevenueCat reports — even if the dashboard accidentally has a ","type":"text"},{"code":"lifetime","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement that the service is not configured to check. See the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Lifetime entitlement is ignored when no permanent-license ID is configured"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" test case for the precise behavior."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"]]},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\